OL,3,GNEWSACollege tutor crowned Britain's
OL,4,Afastest bricklayer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bricklayer from Nottinghamshire has
OL,7,Fbeen crowned the fastest in Britain
OL,8,Fafter coming top in a national
OL,9,Fcompetition.
OL,11,FDale Wherton, who teaches at West
OL,12,FNottinghamshire College's Station Park
OL,13,Fcampus in Kirkby-in-Ashfield, claimed
OL,14,Fthe title at the Super Trowel final at
OL,15,FHertfordshire County Showground. He
OL,16,Flaid 859 bricks in one hour earlier
OL,17,Fthis month.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
