OL,3,GNEWSACollege tutor crowned Britain's
OL,4,Afastest bricklayer
OL,5,
OL,6,FCompetitors were tested not only on the
OL,7,Fnumber of bricks they could lay in one
OL,8,Fhour, but also on the accuracy,
OL,9,Fconsistency and overall quality of
OL,10,Ftheir workmanship, organisers said.
OL,12,FWherton will now represent Britain at
OL,13,Fthe Bricklayer 500 international
OL,14,Fchampionships in Las Vegas in January
OL,15,F2027.
